{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17219240","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17219240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721924001:1":{"text":"小姐，人我带到了。","source_cn":"小姐，人我带到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A1C1D432DCD96B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721924002:1":{"text":"辛苦你了。两位，听说你们有事想求见茜茜夫人？","source_cn":"辛苦你了。两位，听说你们有事想求见茜茜夫人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE408896768DD0083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721924003:1":{"text":"正、正是！您、您就是茜茜夫人？","source_cn":"正、正是！您、您就是茜茜夫人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911628FB92A80F32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721924004:1":{"text":"两位误会了。我叫克萝伊，茜茜夫人是我的座上宾，目前正暂居我府上做客。","source_cn":"两位误会了。我叫克萝伊，茜茜夫人是我的座上宾，目前正暂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4679CC661A3A911C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721924005:1":{"text":"我和茜茜夫人的关系……我算是她某种意义上的监护人吧。","source_cn":"我和茜茜夫人的关系……我算是她某种意义上的监护人吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB13FC709E1D22473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say